              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otalimpongera esagama ey'ekyonzira kyange hamu n'ekyokulya ekitumbisiibwe, noobukwakuba kwahura ekyonzira eky'okwijuka obugenyi obw'okuhingurwaho okuhikya nyenkya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.25",
